  "ruleText": "Rab 501.03 Uniform Code of Ethics. An appraiser shall remain informed and abide by the USPAP ethical and professional conduct standards in effect at the time of the appraisal assignment.\n\nSource. #10270, eff 2-2-13 (from Rab 501.02); ; ss by #13785, eff 12-19-23\n\nAPPENDIX A: Incorporation by Reference Information\n\nRule | Title | Obtain at:\n\nRab 302.01 (a) Rab 302.02 (a) (1) Rab 302.15 Rab 403.02(e) | The Real Property Appraisal Qualifications Criteria and Interpretations of the Criteria, revised January 2022 | The Appraisal Foundation, 1155 15th Street NW, Suite 1111, Washington, DC 20005. Telephone (202)347-7722. Downloadable version is free online at https://appraisalfoundation.sharefile.com/share/view/s63f99dc2b9f2 41e0b3fd1645f7b63680\n\nAPPENDIX B",
